# B-337: Named-field constructor match test.
# Constructor [Ok value: a] generates [fn [...payload] [variant-payload "Result.Ok" payload]].
# Calling [Ok value: 42] creates a variant with payload {value: 42}.
# Pattern match extracts the payload dict as `v`, then accesses `v.value`.
[
  Result: [type [Ok value: a] [Error msg: Str]]
  matched: [match [Ok value: 42]
    [case [let v] [Result.Ok v]    v.value]
    [Result.Error _]:              0]
]
=== out
Dict({"Ok": Function(payload), "Error": Function(payload), "matched": Int(42)})
